{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/01/12/2658923/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/01/12/2658923/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだ、不覚にもこたつで\nうとうとしてしまいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶対寝ちゃだめ...と思っていたから、\nこたつの電源を切って、\n「バカメ、あったかくなければ\n寝るはずがない、ふっふっふ｣\nとぼやきながら、見事にそのまま\n冷たいこたつで寝ました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかも、寝ながら頭まですっぽり\nこたつに入ってしまったようで、\n起きたら目の前が真っ暗で、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うわわわわわわ！！！と\n一人で驚いてジタバタした後、\n静かに罪悪感に浸りました。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日は成人の日ですね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/01/12/2658923/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/01/12/2658923/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国の新成人の皆さん、\n成人おめでとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ろってぃー、まりか、生駒ちゃんも\nおめでとう！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新たな舞台の門出に、心からの\n祝福とエールを送ります\\(﹡ˆoˆ﹡)/ﾌﾚｰﾌﾚｰ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1月9日、10日は握手会でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださった皆さん、\n有難うございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新年の挨拶が沢山できました。\n今年もよろしくお願い致します＾＾♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊ 私服紹介"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/01/12/2658923/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/01/12/2658923/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"：ユニクロ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/01/12/2658923/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"：リネッタ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/01/12/2658923/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"：フラワー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/01/12/2658923/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/01/12/2658923/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"：ユニクロ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/01/12/2658923/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"：リネッタ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/01/12/2658923/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"：リネッタ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふわ〜っとナチュラルな服装が基本。\n＋ 肌を見せない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ボーイッシュなのも好き"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/01/12/2658923/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国握手会は、\nいおりちゃんとペアでした〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/01/12/2658923/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/01/12/2658923/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はぁぁいおりちゃん美しい...\nなんて美人さんなの...\nモデルさんみたい、、というか\nモデルさんになってほしいっす！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、ちなみに井上は\nほっぺに唐揚げを詰め込んでおります。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/01/12/2658923/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お正月実家に帰ったとき、\nお母さんと沢山お花を植えたよ＊＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんというと、朝から「手伝って！｣\nって強制的に叩き起こされたんだけど（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お天気も良かったし、土をいじるのも\n好きだから、楽しかったなあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冬でも井上家はこーんなに賑やか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/01/12/2658923/0014.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/01/12/2658923/0015.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心がやすらぐ〜\n春が楽しみだなあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/01/12/2658923/0016.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/01/12/2658923/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/01/12/2658923/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/01/12/2658923/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆヽ(｡･ω･｡)正義"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/01/12/2658923/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}